ge: 19 years old"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: Slightly tall"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Bust: Large"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Normally, she is a college student, but this might be a disguise used to conceal herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The true identity of her is an Exorcist Ninja named Rin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her supernatural ability is used for exorcism, slaying the demons lurking in the world of darkness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Once, when she was hanging by a thread from a demon attack, she was saved by the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From that moment, she secretly has a crush on him, but due to her serious personality, she finds it difficult to express her feelings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"*Heroine of Vol.2"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c166955"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/85c300258b134a59a7a2279e9fb14692c6c82eda10a6b8c205362343d2c18414.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc4371a3d494259bb1cce5b380aae2dd65f580e05db7fda70d51160340be07e9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"よもぎ かすみ","creatorId":"vndb:s1975","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1975","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1975","name":"清水 美紗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101970","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c166956","characterName":"倉渕 里美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c166956"},"originalCharacterName":"倉渕 里美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An Unforgettable・Soulmate"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: The protagonist's classmate"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: Slightly tall"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Bust: Average"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When the protagonist was living in his hometown, Satomi was his first girlfriend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His soulmate──Or so he thought."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One day, she suddenly disappeared. Since then, he has never heard from her again."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"*This character has H-scenes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c166956"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f29234702d0eedb6fc6eb9e4cfac851e804a9b22dbd7c385527a13f6a17e32a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/65f6ff8705e2700e3d51052f95811a3ad095495064ba71c0718a3e8fdd11584d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"葵 時緒","creatorId":"vndb:s1658","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1658","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1658","name":"葵時緒","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101967","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c166957","characterName":"水科 真琴","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c166957"},"originalCharacterName":"水科 真琴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A Lingering Spirit・Lover"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: 20 years old (Was)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: Slightly tall"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Bust: Average"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's late girlfriend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was working as a street performer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, somebody killed her, but she still lingers close to the protagonist as a spirit."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With his supernatural ability, the protagonist goes out every night, searching for the person responsible for her death."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"*This character has H-scenes as a side content."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c166957"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d5bca695877ff744959d9ade4abe62f4348327ac055e3cbf37606194ec666116.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/13231bc8688529d00067fd59cf9677a3a3dbbef31d32eb456b185183d9683f71.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"みたか りん","creatorId":"vndb:s5060","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5060","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5060","name":"みたか りん","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101968","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c166958","characterName":"グリェール","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c166958"},"originalCharacterName":"グリェール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Reaper of Black Souls・An Angel of Death"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: Probably around 20 years old"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: About average"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Bust: Average"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She worked in pairs with Azrael (Rui) as an Angel of Death."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unlike Rui, who is easy-going for the most part, Gliere is dependable."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though their personalities are different, they get along pretty well, since Rui has been living as a human because of her incarnation, Gliere somet